<title>UK: Three Brent dates kept, two clocked.</title>
<headline>Three Brent dates kept, two clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three of the Brent cargoes nominated on Friday were kept by BP, J.P.Morgan and Phibro while two were clocked, traders said.</p>
<p>They said BP kept a Dec 7-9 cargo as did Phibro. J.P Morgan was clocked with a Dec 8-10 cargo and kept a Dec 9-11 while Glencore was clocked with a 9-11 cargo.</p>
<p>-- Kate Dourian, London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
